<!-- The system splash's icon, empty on purpose. Android 12+ always opens on its own splash window (a colour and one
     icon) and that cannot be turned off; the only way to make the game open on ITS splash alone is to leave that
     icon blank and give the window the scene's own average colour, so the painted opening scene simply appears. -->
